# Linux Leptocline — security toolkit (169 tools).
# Every name was verified to have a real installation candidate in trixie
# (apt-cache policy) AND to co-install cleanly as a set (apt-get install -s),
# so the build cannot fail on a bad or conflicting package.
# Point these at systems you own or are authorised to test.

